-- Vending machine hand-item mapping (furniture_item_hand_item)
-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Sadie's VendingInteractor dispenses a random item from FurnitureItem.HandItems
-- (many-to-many via this join, AutoInclude'd by the model). default.sql ships the
-- `hand_items` definitions but leaves this join EMPTY, and modern furnidata no
-- longer carries the old `vendingids` field -- so vending machines did nothing.
--
-- Each of the 160 furni flagged interaction_type='vending_machine' is mapped to
-- the item(s) it should dispense, derived from the furni NAME in FurnitureData.json
-- (e.g. "Ice Cream Stand"->ice creams, "Fruit Bowl"->fruit, "Fresh Bread Cart"->
-- bread, "Chestnut Roaster"->chestnuts, "Water Cooler"/sinks->water, tea/coffee/
-- cola/cocoa split by name, flowers->flowers; genuine bars/minibars->drink set).
-- Requires `hand_items` to be loaded first (present in default.sql).
-- Idempotent (INSERT IGNORE). Regenerated 2026-06-18 (name-driven, replaces the
-- earlier all-drinks version).
-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Clear any prior vending mappings before reseeding:
DELETE j FROM furniture_item_hand_item j
  JOIN furniture_items fi ON fi.id = j.furniture_items_id
  WHERE fi.interaction_type = 'vending_machine';
